## Minimal Harness workflow

This repository uses `.harness/` as the task and verification source of truth. At the start of every session, run `python3 .harness/harness.py doctor`, then `python3 .harness/harness.py status`, and read `.harness/HANDOFF.md`.

Keep exactly one task in progress. Run command acceptance with `verify`; record browser and manual observations with `record`. Run `complete` only after every acceptance item is passed. Do not treat code written, visual inspection, or an unavailable tool as proof. Respect `allowed_paths`, stop for every operation in `approval_required_operations`, and regenerate the handoff before ending the session.
